    {
      "rank": 6,
      "row_id": 412824,
      "chunk_id": "5adab7c6ab89_0",
      "doc_id": "5adab7c6ab89",
      "text": "Only 3/4 day battery (not 2 days as advertised).. The description say's this phone has a two day battery, but this is grossly wrong. This phone's battery lasts no longer than any other phone's battery. I've had this phone for about a week now, and have charged it to 100% over night every night, yet the phone's battery depletes down to about 10-20% by late afternoon/ earlier evening. I have to put it back on the charger to get through the night. I don't play games on my phone or stream movies. Just basic usage with texting, web surfing, phone calls, etc. Maybe I got a dud, or a used phone, who knows. But what I do know is that this phone's battery DOESN'T last two days as advertised. Today I decided not to charge it in the afternoon, and the phone eventually died at 4:30PM, only giving me about 9.5 hours on a full charge.",
